# Detection: Detect CreateRemoteThread activity that may indicate process injection.
# MITRE ATT&CK Technique: T1055 - Process Injection
# Review before publication: Validate Sysmon Event ID 8 telemetry and field names in the target environment.

search index=wineventlog sourcetype=Sysmon EventCode=8
|fields SourceImage,TargetImage,Computer,StartModule,StartFunction
